0 40 192 [
[(The partials are the multipliers in the [*] objects and go from 0 through 5, where 0 means DC)]
[(\050or 0 Hz frequency\051, 1 is the fundamental, and so on. The toggle switches allow you to turn)]
[(them on and off separately. You have to press the "click to graph" button to update the two)]
[(graphs or use the toggle button to graph repeatedly.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
