0 40 271 [
[(This next series of patches demonstrates various kinds of modulation: AM, waveshaping, and FM.)]
[(We will need a tool for graphing spectra which is introduced here. In this patch the signal to)]
[(be analyzed is a simple sum of up to six partials of a fundamental frequency, which is 187.5 Hz)]
[(\050close to F# below middle C, if your sample rate happens to be 48000 Hz\051. The fundamental is)]
[(chosen to agree with the analysis patch \050[pd FFT]\051 and is computed within [pd init].)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
